          deckDescription: 'A 32-card stripped deck: four French suits with ranks 7 through Ace (Ace high). Preferans NSZ Donauschwaben is a three-player trick-taking game; 10 cards each, 2 in talon; bidding sets contract and trump; play and scoring follow Preferans rules.',
